{"id":"5429","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5429_main_sandstorm_lithometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>沙暴或尘暴是强烈紊流风将大量沙粒或尘粒卷至高空。沙暴前端部分通常呈宽大的高墙状，如图所示，沿着沙特阿拉伯利雅得至麦加的公路相当快速地推进。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Clifford O'Leary","location":"沙特阿拉伯，利雅得，Al-Gjullah","latitude":"纬度: 24° 17' 24'' N","longitude":"经度: 45° 44' 10'' E","date":"13 April 2012 1858 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.12.0","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.12.0"}]}]}